# Line endings are part of the contract.
#
# This repository is consumed as a submodule, and a submodule does NOT inherit the
# parent repository's .gitattributes. Without this file a Windows checkout converts
# the JavaScript to CRLF while every file in the consuming repository stays LF, and
# importing the conformance runner or the lock generator fails there and only there.
#
# It matters beyond the submodule case too: the schemas and fixtures are hashed into
# schemas.lock.json and compared byte for byte. A checkout that rewrites line endings
# changes those bytes, so a conformance run could disagree with itself across platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
